<span class="universe-icon w-[14px] h-[14px] text-icon-n2"><svg width="1em" height="1em" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" data-icon="EditOutlined"><path d="m17.57 7.244-.006-.006.37-.37a1 1 0 0 0 .001-1.412l-3.434-3.453-.002-.002a1 1 0 0 0-1.414 0l-.705.706.01.01L2 13.186V17a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h3.814L17.57 7.244Zm-3.273.389-2.015-2.015 1.487-1.515 2.023 2.034-1.495 1.496Zm-3.415-.587 2.002 2.002-6.913 6.92h-.004l-1.934-1.935v-.003l6.849-6.984ZM3 20a1 1 0 1 0 0 2h18a1 1 0 1 0 0-2H3Z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></span></span></div><div class="flex gap-[16px] flex-wrap"><div class="p-[14px] bg-bg-content-base rounded-xl flex items-center gap-[12px]"><span class="ud__avatar ud__avatar-filled ud__avatar-circle ud__avatar-image shrink-0" style="width: 40px; height: 40px;"><img class="ud__avatar__image" src="https://aily.feishu.cn/play/api/v1/files/static/offcial-logo15.png"></span><span class="text-[14px] leading-[22px] font-normal text-text-title whitespace-nowrap">飞书 aily</span></div></div></div><div><h3 class="text-[14px] leading-[22px] font-medium text-text-title mb-3">使用场景</h3><div class="flex gap-[18px]"><div class="flex-1 bg-[#F8F9FA] border-[0.454px] border-solid border-[#F5F6F7] rounded-xl pt-4 pb-5 px-[22px] flex flex-col gap-1"><span class="text-[22px]">🔍</span><span class="text-[14px] leading-[22px] font-medium text-text-title">客户需求洞察</span><span class="text-[14px] leading-[20px] text-[#646A73]">针对某类产品的客户群体，运用多源研究方法，分析其需求偏好，生成结论并给出置信度评分。</span></div><div class="flex-1 bg-[#F8F9FA] border-[0.454px] border-solid border-[#F5F6F7] rounded-xl pt-4 pb-5 px-[22px] flex flex-col gap-1"><span class="text-[22px]">📊</span><span class="text-[14px] leading-[22px] font-medium text-text-title">市场趋势分析</span><span class="text-[14px] leading-[20px] text-[#646A73]">综合线上线下多渠道信息，对特定市场的发展趋势进行研究，生成研究结果及置信度。</span></div><div class="flex-1 bg-[#F8F9FA] border-[0.454px] border-solid border-[#F5F6F7] rounded-xl pt-4 pb-5 px-[22px] flex flex-col gap-1"><span class="text-[22px]">💡</span><span class="text-[14px] leading-[22px] font-medium text-text-title">竞品策略评估</span><span class="text-[14px] leading-[20px] text-[#646A73]">通过多源信息研究竞争对手的市场策略，评估其效果并生成结论与置信度评分。</span></div></div></div><div class="flex flex-col gap-[12px]"><h3 class="text-[14px] leading-[22px] font-medium text-text-title m-0">示例提示词</h3><div class="bg-bg-content-base rounded-xl p-[22px] flex flex-col gap-[18px]"><div><div class="flex flex-col gap-[4px]"><div class="flex items-center gap-[6px] leading-none"><span class="text-[14px] leading-[22px] font-medium text-static-black">研究客户需求</span><span class="w-[22px] h-[22px] inline-flex items-center justify-center cursor-pointer rounded hover:bg-n900/8"><span class="universe-icon w-[14px] h-[14px] text-icon-n2"><svg width="1em" height="1em" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" data-icon="CopyOutlined"><path d="M9 3a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h10a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v12a1 1 0 1 1-2 0V4h-9a1 1 0 0 1-1-1Z" fill="currentColor"></path><path d="M5 6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v12a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h10a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8a2 2 0 0 0-2-2H5Zm0 2h10v12H5V8Z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></span></span></div><div class="text-[14px] leading-[22px] font-normal text-text-caption">帮我研究一下智能手机客户的需求偏好，给出结论和置信度评分。</div></div></div><div><div class="border-0 border-t-[0.5px] border-solid border-line-border-card mb-[18px]"></div><div class="flex flex-col gap-[4px]"><div class="flex items-center gap-[6px] leading-none"><span class="text-[14px] leading-[22px] font-medium text-static-black">分析市场趋势</span><span class="w-[22px] h-[22px] inline-flex items-center justify-center cursor-pointer rounded hover:bg-n900/8"><span class="universe-icon w-[14px] h-[14px] text-icon-n2"><svg width="1em" height="1em" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" data-icon="CopyOutlined"><path d="M9 3a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h10a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v12a1 1 0 1 1-2 0V4h-9a1 1 0 0 1-1-1Z" fill="currentColor"></path><path d="M5 6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v12a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h10a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8a2 2 0 0 0-2-2H5Zm0 2h10v12H5V8Z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></span></span></div><div class="text-[14px] leading-[22px] font-normal text-text-caption">综合多渠道信息分析新能源汽车市场的发展趋势，并给出置信度。</div></div></div><div><div class="border-0 border-t-[0.5px] border-solid border-line-border-card mb-[18px]"></div><div class="flex flex-col gap-[4px]"><div class="flex items-center gap-[6px] leading-none"><span class="text-[14px] leading-[22px] font-medium text-static-black">评估竞品策略</span><span class="w-[22px] h-[22px] inline-flex items-center justify-center cursor-pointer rounded hover:bg-n900/8"><span class="universe-icon w-[14px] h-[14px] text-icon-n2"><svg width="1em" height="1em" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" data-icon="CopyOutlined"><path d="M9 3a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h10a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v12a1 1 0 1 1-2 0V4h-9a1 1 0 0 1-1-1Z" fill="currentColor"></path><path d="M5 6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v12a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h10a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8a2 2 0 0 0-2-2H5Zm0 2h10v12H5V8Z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></span></span></div><div class="text-[14px] leading-[22px] font-normal text-text-caption">对某品牌运动服装的市场策略进行研究，给出评估结论和置信度。</div></div></div><div><div class="border-0 border-t-[0.5px] border-solid border-line-border-card mb-[18px]"></div><div class="flex flex-col gap-[4px]"><div class="flex items-center gap-[6px] leading-none"><span class="text-[14px] leading-[22px] font-medium text-static-black">生成客户报告</span><span class="w-[22px] h-[22px] inline-flex items-center justify-center cursor-pointer rounded hover:bg-n900/8"><span class="universe-icon w-[14px] h-[14px] text-icon-n2"><svg width="1em" height="1em" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" data-icon="CopyOutlined"><path d="M9 3a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h10a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v12a1 1 0 1 1-2 0V4h-9a1 1 0 0 1-1-1Z" fill="currentColor"></path><path d="M5 6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v12a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h10a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8a2 2 0 0 0-2-2H5Zm0 2h10v12H5V8Z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></span></span></div><div class="text-[14px] leading-[22px] font-normal text-text-caption">运用多源研究方法生成一份关于化妆品客户的研究报告，包含结论和置信度。</div></div></div></div></div><div><h3 class="text-[14px] leading-[22px] font-medium text-text-title mb-3">文件预览</h3><div class="rounded-xl border-[0.5px] border-solid border-[rgba(222,224,227,0.8)] bg-white"><div class="sticky top-[58.5px] z-1 h-9"><div class="absolute -inset-x-px inset-y-0 bg-white"></div><div class="absolute -inset-x-[0.5px] -top-[0.5px] bottom-0 z-1 flex items-center bg-[#F8F9FA] rounded-t-xl border-[0.5px] border-solid border-[rgba(222,224,227,0.8)]"><div class="absolute left-[17px] top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 min-w-0" style="right: 46px;"><span class="block text-[12px] leading-[21px] text-[#4E5158] font-medium truncate" style="font-family: &quot;Source Code Pro&quot;, monospace; font-feature-settings: &quot;ss01&quot;, &quot;cv01&quot;, &quot;cv11&quot;;">客户研究分析</span></div><div class="absolute right-[14px] top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2"><button type="button" class="ud__button ud__button--icon ud__button--icon-default ud__button--icon-size-md p-1!" style="color: var(--token-icon-n3, #8F959E);"><span class="universe-icon text-[16px]!"><svg width="1em" height="1em" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" data-icon="DownloadOutlined"><path d="M20 18a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v2a1 1 0 0 1-1 1H4a1 1 0 0 1-1-1v-2a1 1 0 1 1 2 0v1h14v-1a1 1 0 0 1 1-1Zm-7-3.964 2.657-2.657a1 1 0 0 1 1.414 1.414c-1.414 1.415-2.828 2.83-4.244 4.244a1 1 0 0 1-1.412 0c-1.417-1.415-2.833-2.833-4.249-4.25a.993.993 0 0 1 .013-1.401.992.992 0 0 1 1.401-.013l2.42 2.42V3.5a1 1 0 1 1 2 0v10.536Z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></span></button></div></div></div><div class="flex" style="clip-path: inset(0px round 0px 0px 12px 12px);"><div class="px-[10px] flex-1 min-w-0 overflow-x-hidden bg-white"><div class="cm-theme" style="height: 100%;"><div class="cm-editor ͼ1 ͼ2 ͼ2g ͼ1s"><div class="cm-announced" aria-live="polite"></div><div tabindex="-1" class="cm-scroller"><div spellcheck="false" autocorrect="off" autocapitalize="off" writingsuggestions="false" translate="no" contenteditable="false" style="tab-size: 4;" class="cm-content cm-lineWrapping" role="textbox" aria-multiline="true" aria-readonly="true"><div class="cm-line">---</div><div class="cm-line">name: customer-research</div><div class="cm-line">label: 客户问题调研</div><div class="cm-line">description: 跨文档和知识库调研客户问题，综合输出带置信度评分的答案。适用于调查客户提问、了解客户背景或获取账户上下文信息。</div><div class="cm-line">---</div><div class="cm-line"><br></div><div class="cm-line"># Customer Research Skill</div><div class="cm-line"><br></div><div class="cm-line">You are an expert at conducting multi-source research to answer customer questions, investigate account contexts, and build comprehensive understanding of customer situations. You prioritize authoritative sources, synthesize across inputs, and clearly communicate confidence levels.</div><div class="cm-line"><br></div><div class="cm-line">## Multi-Source Research Methodology</div><div class="cm-line"><br></div><div class="cm-line">### Research Process</div><div class="cm-line"><br></div><div class="cm-line">**Step 1: Understand the Question**</div><div class="cm-line">Before searching, clarify what you're actually trying to find:</div><div class="cm-line">- Is this a factual question with a definitive answer?</div><div class="cm-line">- Is this a contextual question requiring multiple perspectives?</div><div class="cm-line">- Is this an exploratory question where the scope is still being defined?</div><div class="cm-gap" style="height: 5209.11px;"></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="flex items-center justify-center -mt-[14px] text-[10px] leading-[18px] text-text-placeholder">内容来源：<a href="https://github.com/anthropics/knowledge-work-plugins/tree/main/customer-support/skills/customer-research" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-text-placeholder hover:text-text-link-normal no-underline"><a href="https://github.com/anthropics/knowledge-work-plugins/tree/main/customer-support/skills/customer-research" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-text-placeholder hover:text-text-link-normal no-underline">https://github.com/anthropics/knowledge-work-plugins/tree/main/customer-support/skills/customer-research</a></a><span class="ml-[6px]">许可证：Apache 2.0</span></div><div class="flex items-center justify-center -mt-[33px] text-[10px] leading-[18px] text-text-placeholder">Modified by Lark Technologies Pte. Ltd.</div></div></div></div>